{"ID":"20240205153701-j5ipc4h","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153701-j5ipc4h","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153701-j5ipc4h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101542-dxy4myd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163310-euldj9m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101542-dxy4myd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:180,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:180\u0026#125;","title":"马钱子（牵机药）","type":"doc","updated":"20240903092153"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206101542-dxy4myd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101542-dxy4myd","updated":"20240206101546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产福建、台湾、广东、海南、广西、云南等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈钮扣状圆板形，常一面隆起，一面稍凹下，直径1.53cm，厚0.30.6cm。表面密被灰棕或灰绿色绢状茸毛，自中间向四周呈辐射状排列，有丝样光泽。边缘稍隆起，较厚，有突起的珠孔，底面中心有突起的圆点状种脐。质坚硬，平行剖面可见淡黄色白色胚乳，角质状，子叶心形，叶脉5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7条。无臭，味极苦。\n【性味】\t苦，温；有大毒。\n【功效】\t通络止痛，散结消肿。用于风湿顽痹，麻木瘫痪，跌扑损伤，痈疽肿痛；小儿麻痹后遗症，类风湿性关节痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206101538-zqyc1kv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101538-zqyc1kv","updated":"20240206101538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101538-05agp6i.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163310-euldj9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163310-euldj9m","updated":"20240730102606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"马钱子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/马钱子-20240205163310-3pa9mfq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 671px;","style":"width: 661px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"马钱子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/马钱子-20240730102606-4wwcpbl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 661px;\" parent-style=\"width: 671px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730105220-vyzq8il","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730105220-vyzq8il","updated":"20240730110836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 466px;","style":"width: 456px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"马钱子 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/马钱子 3-20240730105336-5upz6ko.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 456px;\" parent-style=\"width: 466px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 543px;","style":"width: 533px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"马钱子 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/马钱子 14-20240730110836-gnr2xdq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 533px;\" parent-style=\"width: 543px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730104821-gazmd9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730104821-gazmd9o","updated":"20240730110915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"